IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `cpa-ownership`

-- Copyright Act 2021, ss 9, 13, 133, 134, 136(1), (2) -- worked cases on first ownership.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case, the Employment Act 1968 or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_cpa_own.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

