§ `REQ-0287 (Haziq scenario, h045)`

-- Salaried engineers (a contract of service) write the company's software in the course of their employment, after
-- 21 November 2021, with nothing in their contracts about ownership. A computer program is a literary work (s 13(1)(b)) and so an
-- authorial work (s 9); s 134(1)(a) applies; the company is not a periodical proprietor, so s 134(4) is out; there is no contrary
-- agreement under s 134(5); so s 134(3): the employer is the first owner.
#ASSERT `the first owner of copyright` `Haziq's company software` EQUALS `the employer`
#ASSERT `the employer owns the whole copyright` `Haziq's company software`
#ASSERT `section 134 applies` `Haziq's company software`
#ASSERT NOT `there is an effective contrary agreement` `Haziq's company software`
#ASSERT NOT `the periodical rule applies` `Haziq's company software`

§ `ss 9, 13 -- kinds of work`

#ASSERT `is a literary work` `computer program`
#ASSERT NOT `is a literary work` `musical work`
#ASSERT `is an authorial work` `computer program`
#ASSERT NOT `is an authorial work` `film`

§ `s 133 -- the default`

-- Not a contract of service: s 134 does not apply, so the author (the contractor) owns, absent a written agreement.
#ASSERT `the first owner of copyright` `software by a freelance contractor` EQUALS `the author`
#ASSERT `the default first owner of` `published edition` EQUALS `the publisher`
#ASSERT `the default first owner of` `broadcast` EQUALS `the broadcasting licensee`
#ASSERT `the default first owner of` `cable programme` EQUALS `the cable programme service provider`
#ASSERT `the default first owner of` `film` EQUALS `the maker`
#ASSERT `the default first owner of` `dramatic work` EQUALS `the author`

§ `ss 133(3), 134(5) -- contrary agreement`

-- From 21 November 2021 only a written agreement counts; before then any agreement does.
#ASSERT `the agreement displaces the default` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the agreement displaces the default` TRUE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT `the agreement displaces the default` TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the agreement displaces the default` FALSE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT `the first owner of copyright` `employee software with a written agreement giving the employee ownership` EQUALS `whoever the contrary agreement names`
#ASSERT `the first owner of copyright` `employee software with an oral agreement made in 2023` EQUALS `the employer`
#ASSERT `the first owner of copyright` `employee software with an oral agreement made in 2019` EQUALS `whoever the contrary agreement names`

§ `s 134(1)(b) -- non-authorial works only from 21 November 2021`

#ASSERT `the first owner of copyright` `an employee's sound recording in 2020` EQUALS `the maker`
#ASSERT `the first owner of copyright` `an employee's sound recording in 2022` EQUALS `the employer`
#ASSERT NOT `section 134 applies` `an employee's broadcast in 2020`
#ASSERT `the first owner of copyright` `an employee's broadcast in 2020` EQUALS `the broadcasting licensee`

§ `s 134(3), (4) -- employees and periodicals`

#ASSERT `the first owner of copyright` `an in-house photograph at a bank in 2023` EQUALS `the employer`
#ASSERT `the first owner of copyright` `a staff journalist's article in 2023` EQUALS `the employer for periodical publication only, the employee for everything else`
#ASSERT NOT `the employer owns the whole copyright` `a staff journalist's article in 2023`
#ASSERT `the first owner of copyright` `a staff journalist's article in 1985` EQUALS `the employer, but the employee may restrain publication other than in a periodical`
-- A musical work is not in s 134(4)(a).
#ASSERT `the first owner of copyright` `a staff composer's jingle for the magazine in 2023` EQUALS `the employer`
-- A computer program is a literary work, so on the words s 134(4) reaches code written for publication in a periodical.
#ASSERT `the first owner of copyright` `a staff developer's code listing for the magazine in 2023` EQUALS `the employer for periodical publication only, the employee for everything else`

§ `s 136(1), (2) -- the Government`

#ASSERT `the first owner of copyright` `a civil servant's unpublished program` EQUALS `the Government`
#ASSERT `the first owner of copyright` `a civil servant's program under a written agreement with the Government` EQUALS `whoever the contrary agreement names`
#ASSERT `the first owner of copyright` `a contractor's film made under Government direction` EQUALS `the Government`
